# The initiative ventures into the Undercity (CR 726.2, 701.49) once when taken and again at each of its controller's
# upkeeps. Bot1 takes it with Caves of Chaos Adventurer on turn 1 (Secret Entrance fetches a Forest) and then walks
# Secret Entrance -> Forge (+2 counters on the Adventurer, turn 3) -> Trap! (Bot2 loses 5, turn 5) -> Archives (draw a
# card, turn 7) -> Throne of the Dead Three (turn 9: reveal ten, a Llanowar Elves enters with three +1/+1 counters and
# hexproof, then shuffle). The last room completes the dungeon (CR 309.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
